{"id":4273,"name":"Ooi! Tonbo","slug":"ooi_tonbo","synopsis":"The story begins with Igarashi, who was disqualified as a pro golfer after a certain \"incident\" and thus moves to Kagoshima Prefecture's Tokara Islands to step out of the limelight. On these islands known as \"Japan's last unexplored wilderness,\" he encounters a naive girl named Tonbo.\n\r\n\n\r\nAs it turns out, these supposedly unexplored islands have a homemade golf course, where Tonbo plays every day. She demonstrates genius-level prowess, playing every kind of shot with just one golf club, a 3-iron. Igarashi is amazed at Tonbo's talent, even as he harbors doubts about her only using a 3-iron. Yet, hidden deep in Tonbo's heart lies a painful, sad past….","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2024,"createdAt":"2024-04-06 02:32:10","updatedAt":"2024-04-06 02:32:10","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":55194},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":47427},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":164440},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18019},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":23421},{"site":"ANN","externalId":28078}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11708,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/4PEBvRqVftd6HcEj2Bm3Vfh4hrFhIeVgPj7Ygimc.jpg"},{"id":11709,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/G290dsC9KzNuUxpvdY6uok9dUKIl18EYHmzfVXEG.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":5,"name":"OLM","slug":"olm"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":345,"name":"Ooi! Tonbo","slug":"ooi_tonbo"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":12828,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12785,"title":"Habatake","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15015,"version":1,"episodes":"1-13","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":17717,"basename":"OoiTonbo-OP1.webm","filename":"OoiTonbo-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/OoiTonbo-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":33549633,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE